andard material cases, especially as it seems that part of the goal of the PR is specifically for mobile devices where memory is already more of a sensitive resource to preserve.\n\nIt should be possible to throw away the original SPIR-V for any shaders that were inlined at least. At best, it needs to be kept around when computing pipeline statistics (optional) or just the size statistic for reduction.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3760439617/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3760781652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115032#issuecomment-3760781652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115032","id":3760781652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gKPlU","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T16:12:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T16:13:14Z","body":"This should help alleviate the memory increase: https://github.com/DarioSamo/godot/commit/554062507e51092bcc8b7f31aff67f8c9c319121\n\nHowever, it is expected that at least some memory increase will remain, as re-spirv must store the inlined shader on its side to be able to generate specializations. Hopefully this alleviates the issue significantly though.\n\nIf anyone can confirm that it works as intended, I'll PR it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3760781652/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3761851144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115032#issuecomment-3761851144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115032","id":3761851144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gOUsI","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_a